Package: libcamx-metadata1
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: Camera metadata management library
 CAMX Metadata is a C library that implements a robust metadata packet system
 for camera applications. It provides a structured interface for handling
 camera-related metadata in embedded systems.
 .
 This package contains the shared runtime library (libcamx_metadata).

Package: libcamx-metadata-dev
Section: contrib/libdevel
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 libcamx-metadata1 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Camera metadata management library - development files
 CAMX Metadata is a C library that implements a robust metadata packet system
 for camera applications. It provides a structured interface for handling
 camera-related metadata in embedded systems.
 .
 This package contains the public headers, pkg-config files and development
 symlinks needed to build software against CAMX Metadata.
